  "instructions": [
    "In a small bowl, whisk together lemon juice, garlic, mustard seeds, and shio-koji cure. Set aside.",
    "In a large bowl, combine pork cubes, parsley, salt, and black pepper. Toss to coat.",
    "Add the lemon-mustard mixture to the pork and toss to coat.",
    "Thread the pork onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large grill pan or grill over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the skewers to the grill pan or grill and cook for 8-10 minutes per side, or until the pork is cooked through and slightly charred.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
